\title{Lowering for ancestry-cycle}
\import{prelude}

\p{The query \code{ancestry-cycle} looks for cycles in the recorded ancestry relation. Such cycles indicate suspicious data:}

\pre{%
\kw{def} ancestry-cycle (m : Family) : Set := \kw{sig}
  a b c : m.Person
  m.is-descendant-of a b
  m.is-descendant-of b c
  m.is-descendant-of c a
\kw{end}
}

